keywords:
  - reconciliation
  - finance
  - lora
  - mlx
  - verifier-as-oracle
abstract: >
  A 1.7B Qwen3 MLX-LoRA adapter for ledger-vs-statement reconciliation.
  On ReconEval v0.1.0 (n=800, seed 777) the champion x5 run scores
  accuracy 0.805, severity-weighted recall 0.901, HIGH recall 1.000,
  parse 1.0. Gold is produced by the forge oracle, not an LLM judge.
